    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga Gibeoni gwareengani Yoshuwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwayiiy ng'asheesu sugoodiga mida giigheawda Yordani bea ng'eanyiida heayeeniga mida jeeda mooheeda ea ghuuta basooda haw deaschi Lebanoni, ea fuga Hiti, ea Amori, ea Ganaani, ea Beresi, ea Hafiti, ea Yebusi iiy ng'asheesu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean geabwat geat eeng'uchi Yoshuwa ea fuga Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwayiiy fuga Gibeoni ng'asheega sin Yoshuwa aba Yeriko ea ghwahita Ayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean geesin milmilanda, ak geeweay nea geehinda geat fuga siicheakta ak geetiing'sa badahuuka digeeniga nyaawa guniyajeega beareadi, ea ghadeatka woosi bea difaayi biissa ea nibearshachi ak ea sinabwaada, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sea geeka meeweadi ak ea sinabwaada aba geeshanga nyaawa, nea geekwa hang'weaka beareadi nea mukaatajeega nyaawa sean ea nigajeamiidi nea nigharshan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geeweesa Yoshuwa nea gwanda museasooda aba Gilgali, ak geeyeesha niny, ea fuga Israeli, “Aseasa geeleabu ng'eanyiida sheagi; asi sina neajeeda sea aseasa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda fuga Israeli ak gwayeesha fuga Hifi, “Gwadeeba andana bugusteanya; abeeda gajeesindaan neajeeda sea agooga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeyeesha Yoshuwa, “Aseasa geawooschi fugeagwa bea gadiyeeda.” Ghwalamda Yoshuwa ak gwayeesha saawa, “Agooga goowooschi geabeang'a? Ak gooleabu yeenu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geeyeesha niny, “Geeleabu ng'eanyiida sheagi muuchi, aba gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U; ak ea siyiinyi iitaanyi, ea ng'asheega sean sin aba Misri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea ng'asheega sean sin aba badayda sugoodigiga asiyeenya bea Amoriin mida giigheawda Yordaniin, ea Sihoni was sugoocheanda Heshboni, ea Ogu sugoocheanda Bashani, mida Ashtaroti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeeshiineasa ghweanigaasa ea fuga ng'eang'deanya sean, ‘Ageani mukaate ak ghoayaadi geadi aba bareanyeeka ak gooweayi aroonyeewana saawa, ak gooyeeshi, aseasa geewooschi fugeagwa bea gadiyeeda; asi beeni sina neajeeda sea aseasa.”’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh mukaateeydeanya gil; geeyeani gealgaasa nea gudea gareadi nea hamiteanya gil bea bareanyeeka, eaweeda ghayi sing'eadi bareanyeeka ng'eang'deang'wa, ak ghamneawa ng'ula, nigajeamiidi, ak ea nigharshan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghadeatsu ikaasa siyiinyi difaayiin abeeda gudea eashish, ak ng'ula nibearshachi; eara hang'weakaasa ea geekaasa ea niwoosiidi aba gideaba geeleabu bareanyeeka sheagi muuchi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gageanu fuga Israeli mukaateeydeaba fugiga ak ghwaak nea miyeenyaash NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin Yoshuwa hoyyoo sea saawa, ak gwasin neajeeda sea saawa, aba gideaba geanung' goobiida; ak gweaksa fuga hees bea fuga bwat geat habeawooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iing'ata eawooji samwagu bea sinooda neajeeda sea saawa, geayiiy gideaba fiisu giischeewda nyaawa gil, ea gideaba gwanda bugusta nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaweay fuga Israeli bareanyeeka aba mujiinajeegeaba fugiga ak geahita eaweedeaba samwagu. Ak mujiinajeega nyaawa ea Gibeoni gil, ea Gefira, ea Beroti, ea Giriat-yearimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu fuga Israeli ea mutghabwar saawa, aba gideaba fuga hees bea fuga bwatgeat niyeaksa habeawooda saawa aba NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Israeli. Hean gooniiksa fuga bwat geat fuga hees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda fuga hees sean ak gwayeesha fuga sean bwat geat, “Siyeaksi saawa habeawooda aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Israeli, ak ghamneawa ea mwajeasada saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih gajeesisiina saawa, ak geanung'waadi saawa goobiida, aba gideaba adiidu ghwahidu nyarasta ASEETA badaydeanya aba habeawooda siyeaksi saawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha fuga hees saawa, “Anung'waada saawa goobiida.” Ak gayghoah fuga jea gabeara ghweenga nea gwaramu beega fuga sean bwatgeat gawuurji gidarukusiinda fuga hees saawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobalool Yoshuwa saawa nea gwayeesha, “Ghwasaan anda gooreenganeasa nea gooyeenyi ‘Geewooschi sheageeweegwa muuchi;’ nea ghana goondi bugusteanya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa simwaashtaneegwa, ak fiisu ng'ay aba jeedeang'wa gayghoah soomjooga nea gabeara ghweenga ak gwaramu beega gheeda ASEETEANYU.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geasha Yoshuwa nea geeyeesha, “Geebaysiini gideaba geerukusa fugaagu bea gadiyeeda huumeanda gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U gwarukusa siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda was Musa gideaba gaygagooneegwa ng'eanyiini seaniin, ak ghwanung' goosha fuga sean bea ng'eanyiida aba madeedeang'wa; ak aba sareani geabeali muuchi aba eaweagaasa aba badaydeang'wa, ak ghoah gida sisini ng'asheanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa, ng'ula, geendi geatingeagwa, asi gididaakti gideaba aamiy nea doabiiwaat aba headaang'u jea asimaneasa asi asimaneasa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasindunu saawa, ak ghaaghu aba geatinda fuga Israeli; ak ea meabwara saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eaweedida ghwanung' Yoshuwa gabeara saawa ghweenga nea gwaramu beega fuga bwat geat, ea gea heeda wagiida bea NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gwasin ea ghoah ghamneawa, aba heeda loat niny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
